[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4861.189, "timestamp": "01:21:01", "text": "因为它会给你带来那种化学物质。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4863.83, "timestamp": "01:21:03", "text": "你大脑中的这种反应使你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4866.27, "timestamp": "01:21:06", "text": "无论如何，我都开心。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4869.189, "timestamp": "01:21:09", "text": "坦白说，这不太好。是的，并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4871.11, "timestamp": "01:21:11", "text": "好的。不太好。甚至吸吮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4873.51, "timestamp": "01:21:13", "text": "像棍子一样伸出来也不好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4876.63, "timestamp": "01:21:16", "text": "是的，我不喜欢。但是，是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4879.03, "timestamp": "01:21:19", "text": "效果显著，而且价格低廉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4883.189, "timestamp": "01:21:23", "text": "所以，就像是“是的”。所以，也许是吧。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4885.189, "timestamp": "01:21:25", "text": "最近，差不多就满一年了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4887.11, "timestamp": "01:21:27", "text": "我今年连一根烟都没抽过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4889.11, "timestamp": "01:21:29", "text": "记住，没错。即将满一年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4891.03, "timestamp": "01:21:31", "text": "现在。我今年还没抽过烟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4893.91, "timestamp": "01:21:33", "text": "出奇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4895.43, "timestamp": "01:21:35", "text": "虽然我压力大得要命。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4897.51, "timestamp": "01:21:37", "text": "因为工作，但我好像没有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4898.95, "timestamp": "01:21:38", "text": "我没抽过烟。我还没到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4900.79, "timestamp": "01:21:40", "text": "气到极点，真是气疯了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4903.669, "timestamp": "01:21:43", "text": "还是累了。但是，嗯，喝酒就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4906.07, "timestamp": "01:21:46", "text": "非常非常常见。事情是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4908.47, "timestamp": "01:21:48", "text": "我其实不怎么喝酒，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4910.63, "timestamp": "01:21:50", "text": "你们都知道这一点。我走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4913.43, "timestamp": "01:21:53", "text": "生日直播的时候喝得太烂了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4915.83, "timestamp": "01:21:55", "text": "我他妈的再也不想喝酒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4918.47, "timestamp": "01:21:58", "text": "但如果朋友不喝酒，我也会和他们一起喝。"}]